  "comment": "An expressed pattern recolors the furhood-trim automatically, even without an authored motif PNG. Species partColors.{front,back} can route natural front/back sprite pixels to base or pattern pigment (pattern falls back to base). Grehlr front/back are special: white neutral stripe pixels stay unchanged until coloredstripe is expressed, then hue/saturation follows coloredstripe; mint pixels in back follow base coat. patterns[geneId] adds optional dev-painted motif geometry, distinct from normal player weaving. Fur details with exact RGB #94858E or #567372 never recolor. Optional trimColor: base or pattern; Drenkirra uses base for trim and pattern for front. The global excludedColors list protects exact source RGB values on all hoods; excludedColorsByRole on species adds per-raw-layer RGB swatches. Both are editable using the raw sprite eyedropper.",
